DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerIsrael MedinaGet ready to laug
 h your socks off with some killer stand-up comedy in a chill spot! What’
 s better than comedy\, drinks\, and sandwiches!\nThe equation is simple: Y
 ou + drinks + Bay Area’s top comedians = One hell of a time at The Sandw
 ich Spot.\n\nEase into through your week right at The Sandwich Spot and wa
 tch the Bay Area’s best comics work!\n\nWe’re talking comics who have 
 performed all over the Bay Area at places like:\nSan Francisco Punchline\n
 Cobb’s Comedy Club\nSan Jose Improv\n\nAnd more!\nWhether you’re a com
 edy nerd who knows every Bill Burr special by heart or just someone who ne
 eds a laugh after a long week\, this show delivers.\nGrab your friends\, o
 rder a drink\, and let us do the heavy lifting (of making you laugh).\nDoo
 rs open at 7:00PM. Show starts at 7:30PM.\nDon’t be late – we start on
  time and the first comic always roasts late comers.\nAbout Peninsula Come
 dy:\nPeninsula Comedy is a collective of comedians bringing stand-up to th
 e often-overlooked spots between SF and San Jose. We run shows all through
 out the Peninsula at venues like:\n\nMarvin Gardens in Belmont\nBlue Oak B
 rewing in San Carlos\nAlpha Acid in Belmont\n\nAnd more spots we’re addi
 ng every month!\nOur mission is simple: make the Peninsula a comedy destin
 ation.\nWant to catch our next show?\nFollow us @PeninsulaComedy and @emon
 dismore on Instagram for updates\, lineups\, and more!\nhttps://www.instag
 ram.com/emondismore/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/peninsulacomedy/\n\nFree\n
 \nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2004571114164?aff=oddtdtcreator\nD
 etails: https://sf.funcheap.com/standup-comedy-show-secret-sauce-comedy-3/
 \nSource: Funcheap SF
