SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:comedy
DESCRIPTION:Live stand-up comedy in San Francisco: Bernice Ye brings her a
 cclaimed solo show Wuhan Clan Ain’t Nuthin’ ta Duck Wit to Manny’s i
 n the Mission for one night only – Saturday\, November 14.\nShe landed i
 n the U.S. from Wuhan\, China with $1\,000 and a computer science degree. 
 She built a career at Microsoft and Hulu\, then walked away from tech for 
 the comedy stage. Now she’s an international touring comedian\, comedy r
 apper\, and Taekwondo black belt dubbed “The Jackie Chan of Comedy” by
  The Stranger\, with 400K+ followers and over 100 million views online.\nW
 uhan Clan Ain’t Nuthin’ ta Duck Wit is where razor-sharp stand-up\, in
 fectious rap hooks\, martial arts\, audience interaction\, and cinematic m
 ultimedia collide. It’s a show about identity\, ambition\, and building 
 your own clan when the world doesn’t hand you one. Part comedy special\,
  part concert\, and unlike anything else on the comedy circuit.\nHer work 
 has been featured in the Wall Street Journal and the Los Angeles Times.\n
 “She hypnotizes you. You leave lighter\, louder\, and with her songs stu
 ck in your head.”\n“High-energy and hilarious – Bernice keeps surpri
 sing you.”\n“Beautifully woven from personal experience… resilient\,
  sharp\, and universally resonant.”\nManny’s is one of the few rooms i
 n the country where this show makes complete sense\, a civic gathering spa
 ce in the Mission built for exactly this kind of night. San Francisco\, jo
 in the Wuhan Clan.\n\nPublished by Mission Local\nContains information fro
 m CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://missionlo
 cal.org/event/mannys-bernice-ye-wuhan-clan-aint-nuthin-ta-duck-wit-live-co
 medy-sf/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco
 -ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T171419Z
LOCATION:Manny’s\, 3092 16th St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103\, United St
 ates
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://missionlocal.org/event/mannys-bernice-ye-wuhan-clan-aint-nuthi
 n-ta-duck-wit-live-comedy-sf/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_c
 ampaign=san-francisco-ca
