BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lady Bushra’s Queer Comedy Night in a Romance Bookstore
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T210000
DTSTAMP:20261022T214235Z
UID:funcheap-1643960@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCaleb ZeringueThe Love Potion 
 Library is a cozy romance bookstore in the Castro\, and what better locati
 on for a (mostly) queer comedy show?​\n​See mostly queer BBC and NYtim
 es featured-comics without leaving the Gayborhood 🥰!\n\n​ HEADLINER L
 ADY BUSHRA\n​Lady Bushra is the fabulous British-Pakistani drag comedian
  known for her razor-sharp wit\, outrageous humour\, and unapologetic glam
 our. Blending stand-up comedy with hilarious cultural observations\, she h
 as entertained audiences across the UK and USA. Now she’s bringing her s
 ignature sass and mischief to San Francisco!\n​✨ ALSO ON THE LINEUP 
 ✨\n​Caleb Zeringue– NYTimes and Vulture featured comedian\, co-write
 r of Luigi the Musical and The Drillmaster! seen on Sniffies!\n​Caleb ha
 s featured for Joanne McNally\, Jenny Zigrino\, and opened for the likes o
 f Ricci Armani\, Lady Bushra and men at Buena Vista Park! He brings southe
 rn charm to east coast brutality and is trying to be funny AND nice. Give 
 him pointers on how to do that!\n​remaining lineup to be announced!\n​
 Bits is a traveling comedy show of mostly queer\, slightly crazy\, funny p
 eople.\n​We’ve played sold-out backyards\, cafes\, and that one sauna 
 that has never once worked. Featuring comics from Luigi the Musical (CNN\,
  NYTimes\, WaPo\, Rolling Stone)\, Don’t Tell Comedy\, SF Sketchfest\, T
 he Punchline\, Cobb’s\, LGBTLOLFEST\, Gotham Comedy Club NYC\, and The S
 tand NYC.\n​ The Love Potion Library\, 284 Noe St\, San Francisco\, CA 9
 4114 (right under Lookout)\n️ Sunday...\n\n$20.00\n\nTickets: https://lu
 ma.com/mimifgp9\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/lady-bushras-queer-comed
 y-night-romance-bookstore-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screen
 shot-2026-10-22-at-1.47.23-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T214235Z
LOCATION:The Love Potion Library\, 284 Noe St\, San Francisco\, CA 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/lady-bushras-queer-comedy-night-romance-bookst
 ore-sf/
END:VEVENT
