DESCRIPTION:Infamous Boom Boom Comedy Showcase (3rd Wednesdays)\nSF’s lo
 ngest-running monthly comedy showcase every 3rd Wednesday. Rising comics\,
  surprise guests\, unforgettable laughs in a legendary room.\n\nJoin us fo
 r the always anticipated monthly and highly regarded Value Culture BOOM BO
 OM Comedy Showcase at the famous Boom Boom Room on Fillmore Street since 2
 023!\n\nThe showcase is the longest running monthly showcase active in the
  city\, and has been voted one of the top date nights in SF.\n\n21+\, Free
  with RSVP\, No Drink Minimum\, ($10 suggested tip)\nComics are performing
  for tips. Reserved Seating available for purchase.\n\n7:30 Doors/ 8:00pm 
 Showtime roughly 60-90 minutes\, with more drinks and DJ music to follow.\
 nAddress: 1601 Fillmore St.\, San Francisco\, CA 94115\n\nPlease help us s
 pread the word. Thank you for the support every 3rd Wednesday of the month
 !\n\nThis special comedy event showcases new comics every month on 3rd Wed
 nesdays. Hosted by future local comedy legends Stephanie Block\, Paul Robe
 rtson and often special guests... sometimes non profit Value Culture's lea
 der Adam Swig (if Dave Chappelle doesn't show up...) Always expect lots of
  Special Guests and the unexpected!\n\nThis event supports independent com
 ics\, this independent venue\, diversity and inclusion\, the Western Addit
 ion neighborhood\, and a non profit organization. The event is presented b
 y Value Culture\, a California 501c3 non profit and the Boom Boom Room. Th
 is is the fourth year of the showcase (formerly at the Hungry i) a...\n\nF
 ree\nValue Culture\n\nTickets: valueculture.org/comedy\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/11/18/infamous-boom-boom-comedy-showcase-3rd-wedne
 sdays-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
