DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMegan Thompson\n\nEnter a worl
 d of colorful camp and deliberately outrageous comedy\, featuring two of J
 ohn Waters’ most iconic films: Cry-Baby and Serial Mom\n\nThe night begi
 ns with themed specialty drinks inspired by the unforgettable characters o
 f John Waters. Enjoy music\, mingle with fellow movie lovers\, and settle 
 in before the show.\n\nThen sit back to enjoy cult classics Cry-Baby and S
 erial Mom on the big screen. Whether you’re a longtime John Waters fan o
 r discovering his work for the first time\, this double feature promises a
 n evening of laughter\, nostalgia\, and delightfully twisted entertainment
 .\nHome\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/secret-cinema-s
