 laDesi Comedy Night with HellaFunny and Funcheap at a HellaSecret comedy v
 enue with easy access to BART.\nSee a showcase of some of the Bay Area’s
  top comedians of Indian\, Pakistani\, Sri Lankan\, Bangladeshi\, Afghan\,
  and South Asian descent – plus the best of “Crazy Funny Asians” wit
 h comics of Asian descent. Let’s celebrate the Bay’s Desi culture and 
 heritage with laughs.\n– ———————\n> First 100 people to RS
 VP get free tickets. You’ll get the secret Location via SMS and email ri
 ght after you book tickets.\nTICKETS / EVERY FRIDAY & SATURDAY at 7pm and 
 9pm\n\nFREE with Eventbrite RSVP – Donations appreciated – bring cash\
 nSecret Location – Near Hayes Valley / Civic Center\, San Francisco\nMAX
 IMUM TWO COMP TICKETS PER PERSON – If you have additional guests you’d
  like to bring\, they must RSVP separately\nLike most comedy clubs\, there
  is a two-drink minimum to help support the bar and waitstaff\n\nLike all 
 things in life\, the comedy lineup is subject to change.\nDesi Comedy Nigh
 t / Comedy Lineup\nEvery week is a new lineup. Here are some of our favori
 tes you might see…\n\nRuby Gill-SF Sketchfest\nJanesh Ranlan- San Jose I
 mprov\nDhaya Lakshminarayanan-Comedy Central Asia\nSureni Wereasakera-SF S
 ketchfest\nArjun Bunargee-Cobbs\nPriyanaka Wali-Cobbs\nRaj Reina-Desi Come
 dy Night\nRyan Sudhakaran-San Jose Improv\nPlus many more – including th
 e best of “Crazy Funny Asians”\n\nLike all thi...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: 
 https://www.eventbrite.com/e/sfs-helladesi-comedy-night-tickets-5539201400
 5?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-tix-hellasecret
 -desi-comedy-night-live-in-sf-7p-9p-95/\nSource: Funcheap SF
