  and Rahul Pandya bring you the best stand-up comedians at Hometown Heroes
  bar in Emeryville.\nHometown Free Comedy Night & Happy Hour\nEvery first 
 Wednesday | Show starts at 8 pm\nHometown Heroes\, 4000 Adeline St\, Emery
 ville\nFREE with an RSVP\nThe bar features exclusive drink specials just f
 or comedy night as well as a menu of modernized Filipino classics like kar
 e kare and lumpia.\n– Updated 7/6/19 – Event info last checked via web
