DESCRIPTION:“The Stoner Comedy Jam” Friday Nights (SF)\nHellaFunny\nYo
 u know what makes stand-up comedy funnier? Smoking while watching it live!
  Come to San Francisco’s premiere cannabis club Moe Greens every Friday 
 night for a night of laughter and\, well\, getting stoned.\nHellaFunny is 
 taking over the cannabis lounge at Moe Greens for the Stoner Comedy Jam. I
 t’s one of the only comedy show in San Francisco where you can (legally 
 in California) get high during the show.\n\nThe Stoner Comedy Jam\nEvery F
 riday at 8pm\nMoe Greens\, 1276 Market St.\, San Francisco\nFree with Gues
 t List RSVP\n\nIt’s a 70+ minute show with 4-5 of SF’s top local comic
 s on the bill\n21+ only\nOne item minimum purchase required\n\nFAQ\nIs thi
 s comedy show really free?\nYes! Just make sure to RSVP to get on the gues
 tlist. You must be 21+.\nTell me about the one-item minimum.\nIn order to 
 hook you up with this free comedy show\, there’s one-item minimum purcha
 se per person\, but it’s super affordable (and way cheaper than a tradit
 ional two-drink minimum at a bar!)\nDo I need a medical marijuana card?\nN
 ope! All you need to be is 21+ and have a valid ID.\nDo I have to smoke du
 ring the show?\nNope! You can smoke\, dab\, eat a gummy.. whatever you wan
 t! Or you can just enjoy the show. The one-item minimum purchase still app
 lies. So buy something and a give it to a friend! If you do decide to cons
 ume onsite\, just make sure to take is slow and know your body and your li
 mits.\nCan I bring outside weed?\nSorry! That’s not cool (and it’s not
  legal). In...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.universe.com/events/the-sf-
 stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-at-8p-tickets-8P0JBR\nDetails: https://sf.
 funcheap.com/the-stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-sf-193/\nSource: Funcheap
  SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/HalfBa
 ked_eventbrite.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261101T001103Z
LOCATION:Moe Greens\, 1276 Market St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/the-stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-sf-193/
