CATEGORIES:comedy
DESCRIPTION:Performing Live:\n\nPeter Angelo\nWith:\nWonder Dave\n\nPictur
 e this: a gay metalhead truck driver walks into a comedy club. It sounds l
 ike the setup to a joke\, but it actually perfectly describes our headline
 r -- Peter \\"Metal Pete\\" Angelo. Peter is a stand-up comedian based in 
 Austin\, Texas\, who traded a career in truck driving for the stage. For e
 ight years\, he toured the country in an 18-wheeler\, presumably blasting 
 Death Metal while navigating both America's highways and his own journey o
 f self-discovery. Coming out of the closet is hard enough without having t
 o do it at truck stops from coast to coast. Peter's comedy breaks every st
 ereotype you can think of\, proving you can't judge a book by its cover\, 
 especially when that cover features leather jackets\, muscles\, and an ine
 xplicable knowledge of both diesel engines and show tunes.\n\nWonder Dave 
 is a comedian\, writer and performer from Minneapolis\, MN\, living in Cal
 ifornia. He hosts and produces Safe Words Showcase - Queer Sex Positive Co
 medy and SMILF - Straight Men I'd Like to Friend with producer Jonah Price
 \, hosts Hysteria: Open Mic for Women and Queers\, hosts and produces Ment
 al Health Comedy Hour with comedian Kristee Ono\, and Co-Hosts Ruckus and 
 Rumpus Revival with Jamie DeWolf.\n\ncomedy.\n6pm - 8pm.\n21+ with ID.\n\n
 $19 limited advance\;\n$27 after\;\n$37 door.\n\nBuy tickets: https://www.
 dnalounge.com/calendar/2026/12-05a.html\n\nWatch and listen:\nPeter Angelo
 : Creek and the Cave: https://youtu.be/O8uL8FXlefQ\nWonder Dave: Muppets..
 .\n\nPublished by DNA Lounge\nContains information from CalDiscovery (cald
 iscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://www.dnalounge.com/calendar/20
 26/12-05a.html?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-fra
 ncisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T110227Z
LOCATION:DNA Lounge\, 375 Eleventh Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.dnalounge.com/calendar/2026/12-05a.html?utm_source=caldisc
 overy&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
