 enue with easy access to BART.\nSee a showcase of some of the Bay Area’s
  top comedians of Indian\, Pakistani\, Sri Lankan\, Bangladeshi\, Afghan\,
  and South Asian descent – plus the best of “Crazy Funny Asians” wit
 h comics of Asian descent. Let’s celebrate the Bay’s Desi culture and 
 heritage with laughs.\n– ———————\n> First 100 people to RS
 VP get free tickets. You’ll get the secret Location via SMS and email ri
 ght after you book tickets.\nTICKETS / EVERY FRIDAY & SATURDAY at 7pm and 
 9pm\n\nFREE with Eventbrite RSVP – Donations appreciated – bring cash\
 nSecret Location – Near Hayes Valley / Civic Center\, San Francisco\nMAX
 IMUM TWO COMP TICKETS PER PERSON – If you have additional guests you’d
