SUMMARY:SF’s HellaSecret “Crazy Funny Asians” Friday Night Comedy Sh
 owcase (7p + 9p)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T220000
DTSTAMP:20261031T055320Z
UID:funcheap-1645269@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:SF’s HellaSecret “Crazy Funny Asians” Friday Night Comed
 y Showcase (7p + 9p)\nHellaFunny\nInspired by the blockbuster movie\, see 
 some of the Bay Area’s top comedians at San Francisco’s Crazy Funny As
 ians comedy showcase\, presented by Funcheap and HellaFunny. Let’s celeb
 rate the Bay’s Asian-American culture and heritage with laughs at a secr
 et location – a two-floor comedy club near BART with a full bar\, craft 
 cocktails\, comfy seating and upstairs lounge.\nFree tickets for the first
  50 people to RSVP\nHellaSecret “Crazy Funny Asians” Comedy Showcase\n
 Every Friday & Saturday at 7pm + 9pm\nSecret Location – Near Hayes Valle
 y / Civic Center\, San Francisco\nFREE with RSVP (Donations appreciated 
 – bring cash) – limited to first 50\nTickets\n– FREE with Eventbrite
  RSVP – Donations appreciated – bring cash\n– Maximum Two Comp Ticke
 ts Per Person – If you have additional guests you’d like to bring\, th
 ey must RSVP separately\n– $20 door (without RSVP)\n– Lineup subject t
 o change\n– Admission is first come first served\n– Like most comedy c
 lubs\, there is a two-drink minimum to help support our local bar scene.\n
 Hosted by K. Cheng (NBC’s Stand Up for Diversity\, Khmers of Comedy\, Ho
 st SF Chinese New Year Parade Pre-Show)\nCrazy Funny Asians Comedy Lineup\
 nEvery week is a new lineup. Here are some of our favorites you might see
 …\n\nJeen Yee-Tommy Ts\nChris Posadas-Tommy Ts\nShawn Felipe-WorldAsia T
 V\, Sprint Comedy\nNicole Tran- Tommy T’s\nRyan Chan- Opened for Earthqu
 ake\nMoon Choe- SF Sketchfest\nAndrew Orofolo-SF...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: ht
 tps://www.eventbrite.com/e/hellasecret-crazy-funny-asians-comedy-show-live
 -in-san-francisco-tickets-888006650797?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https:/
 /sf.funcheap.com/sfs-hellasecret-crazy-funny-asians-friday-night-comedy-sh
 owcase-7p-9p-86/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/CrazyF
 unnyAsians-e1535334557269.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261031T055320Z
LOCATION:Secret Location (SF)\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-hellasecret-crazy-funny-asians-friday-nigh
 t-comedy-showcase-7p-9p-86/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“The Stoner Comedy Jam” Friday Nights
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T213000
DTSTAMP:20261101T001103Z
UID:funcheap-1645396@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:“The Stoner Comedy Jam” Friday Nights (SF)\nHellaFunny\nYo
 u know what makes stand-up comedy funnier? Smoking while watching it live!
  Come to San Francisco’s premiere cannabis club Moe Greens every Friday 
 night for a night of laughter and\, well\, getting stoned.\nHellaFunny is 
 taking over the cannabis lounge at Moe Greens for the Stoner Comedy Jam. I
 t’s one of the only comedy show in San Francisco where you can (legally 
 in California) get high during the show.\n\nThe Stoner Comedy Jam\nEvery F
 riday at 8pm\nMoe Greens\, 1276 Market St.\, San Francisco\nFree with Gues
 t List RSVP\n\nIt’s a 70+ minute show with 4-5 of SF’s top local comic
 s on the bill\n21+ only\nOne item minimum purchase required\n\nFAQ\nIs thi
 s comedy show really free?\nYes! Just make sure to RSVP to get on the gues
 tlist. You must be 21+.\nTell me about the one-item minimum.\nIn order to 
 hook you up with this free comedy show\, there’s one-item minimum purcha
 se per person\, but it’s super affordable (and way cheaper than a tradit
 ional two-drink minimum at a bar!)\nDo I need a medical marijuana card?\nN
 ope! All you need to be is 21+ and have a valid ID.\nDo I have to smoke du
 ring the show?\nNope! You can smoke\, dab\, eat a gummy.. whatever you wan
 t! Or you can just enjoy the show. The one-item minimum purchase still app
 lies. So buy something and a give it to a friend! If you do decide to cons
 ume onsite\, just make sure to take is slow and know your body and your li
 mits.\nCan I bring outside weed?\nSorry! That’s not cool (and it’s not
  legal). In...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.universe.com/events/the-sf-
 stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-at-8p-tickets-8P0JBR\nDetails: https://sf.
 funcheap.com/the-stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-sf-195/\nSource: Funcheap
  SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/HalfBa
 ked_eventbrite.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261101T001103Z
LOCATION:Moe Greens\, 1276 Market St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/the-stoner-comedy-jam-friday-nights-sf-195/
END:VEVENT
