  show blends chaos\, sharp wit\, and audience interaction for a truly one
 ‑of‑a‑kind night out in the Bay Area.\nDrunk Theatre SF\nSaturday Ni
 ghts in December\nEclectic Box\, 446 Valencia Street\, SF\nGet FREE Ticket
 s – FREE for first 15 people w/ code FUNCHEAP – $23.18 adv / $25 door\
 n\nDoor opens at 9:15pm\, show starts at 9:30pm (starts promptly)\nLimited
  ticket availability at the door.\n\n*The event is open to all ages\, but 
 the comedy may not be suitable for children.\n24-hour notice is required f
 or cancelations. Late cancelations may be transferred to another show date
  of your choosing. Seating is first come\, first serve. Parties later than
  15-20 minutes may have their tickets sold at the door.\n\n2026 San Franci
 sco Drunk Theatre Schedule\nNovember – December 2026 shows\n\nSaturday\,
