SUMMARY:Cheaper Than Therapy: New Year's Eve 2026 @ 10:30 PM
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261231T223000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270101T003000
DTSTAMP:20261101T160546Z
UID:dothebay-17911932@sf-cal
