CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Late show starts at 10:30 PM\n\nRing in the new year with Chea
 per Than Therapy! Your ticket gets you into the Shelton Theater to start l
 aughing at 10:30 PM on December 31\, 2026\, and includes a champagne toast
  at midnight. Join us for an after-party to welcome 2027 with live musicia
 ns.\n\nCheaper Than Therapy offers a healthy dose of live stand-up comedy 
 every Wednesday\, Thursday\, Friday\, Saturday\, and Sunday\, year-round. 
 Located in San Francisco's historic Shelton Theater in the heart of Union 
 Square\, Cheaper Than Therapy is convenient to get to\, whether you live i
 n the Bay Area or are just visiting.\n\nCheck out our reviews on Yelp\, Go
 ogle\, and Facebook.\n\nAbout the show\n\nEach show features five to six h
 and-picked\, experienced comedians and an occasional guest drop-in.\n\nPle
 ase arrive at the theater by 10:15 PM to check in with the box office. The
  bar opens at 9:30 PM\, and the show starts at 10:30 PM. Last seating is a
 t 10:50 PM.\n\nThe theater has a full bar with no drink minimum. Come earl
 y for craft drinks and great seats!\n\nThe early New Year's Eve show will 
 end at midnight\, but the party will go on till we drop. If public transit
  agencies work as in previous years\, we expect that BART will offer speci
 al service from 8 PM December 31\, 2026\, till 3 AM January 1\, 2027\; and
  MUNI will offer free NYE service from 8 PM December 31\, 2026\, till 5 AM
  January 1\, 2027. For a list of restaurant recommendations in the area\, 
 please visit our website.\n\nWe encourage everyone 21+ to party with us a.
 ..\n\n$75\, 18+\nCTT Comedy presents\n\nTickets: https://tickets.cttcomedy
 .com/events/2676/cheaper-than-therapy-stand-up-comedy-new-year-s-eve-2026-
 10-30-pm/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/31/cheaper-than-th
 erapy-new-year-s-eve-2026-10-30-pm-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
