DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer“Safe Words” Comedy & Hot 
 Dogs | SF\nSafe Words\nSafe Words is a comedy show at a leather bar that f
 eatures the talent of nationally touring comics\, to local favorites. Face
 s from Comedy Central\, Conan\, Reddit & Vice have graced the stage. Even 
