SUMMARY:Mortified
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270108T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270108T203000
DTSTAMP:20261109T114430Z
UID:caldiscovery-comedy-7363924a6ce17aae@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:comedy,literary
DESCRIPTION:MORTIFIED\n\nMortified is a comic excavation of adolescent wri
 ting\, art & media. PS: It totally likes you.\n\nPerformers TBA...\n\nHail
 ed as a \\"cultural phenomenon\\" by Newsweek and celebrated for years by 
 the likes of This American Life\, The Today Show\, The Onion AV Club\, & E
 ntertainment Weekly\, Mortified is a comic excavation of teen angst artifa
 cts (journals\, poems\, letters\, lyrics\, home movies\, schoolwork) as sh
 ared by their original authors -- in front of total strangers!\n\nWhere el
 se can you hear grown men and women confront their past with firsthand tal
 es of their first kiss\, first puff\, worst prom\, fights with mom\, life 
 at bible camp\, worst hand job\, best mall job\, and reasons they deserved
  to marry Bon Jovi? Submissions come from a wide range of participants\, f
 rom professional performers to total amateurs . All in the noble pursuit o
 f self-degradation. Share the shame.\n\nTickets and Seating Information:\n
 \nGeneral Admission tickets do not include guaranteed seating. When the se
 ats are full\, there is ample standing room.\n\nReserved Seating is sold b
 y the chair\, and is in the first or second row.\n\nPizza Special: A table
  for five\, admission for five\, and a large two topping pizza!\n\nFront R
 ow VIP: A table for five right in front of the stage\, including admission
  for five and bottle service.\n\nDownstairs VIP Booths: These are against 
 the wall with a good view of the stage and include admission for six and b
 ottle service.\n\nUpstairs VIP\, and Double: These don't have an unimpeded
  view...\n\nPublished by DNA Lounge\nContains information from CalDiscover
 y (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://www.dnalounge.com/cale
 ndar/2027/01-08a.html?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=
 san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T114430Z
LOCATION:DNA Lounge\, 375 Eleventh Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.dnalounge.com/calendar/2027/01-08a.html?utm_source=caldisc
 overy&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
END:VEVENT
